      "raw": "<p>My partners and I are performing at the Indy Improv Festival next weekend, and will (may?) have a lot of free time on our hands! I know several of you regular folks are from the area, is there anything we should definitely visit or experience?&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We often default to eating, local alcohol, and mini-golf, so anything outside of that or solidly within that would be most helpful.</p>",
