      "id": 222731,
      "name": "Ario",
      "username": "Ario",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ario/{size}/1866_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-10-08T17:47:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you everyone! That mini-golf course looks really great, and all the recomendations on food look exciting too.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>@Jff I do love capital tours, when my wife and I were last in Indy (when time was much more compressed,) we managed to see that and the Civil War musuem before we had to leave.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>@Arenson, we're performing a show where actors perform scripts from plays and improvisers improvise the other half of the scene without knowing the script, it's (almost) always spectacular. We're performing Saturday at 7:30 at the Indy Fringe Theater as part of the crossroads Comedy festival (the act is called Magical Lying Hour.)&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
